**1. Goal Setting & Mindset**

* **Start Small & Specific:** Don't aim to "become fluent" immediately. Instead, set tiny, achievable goals. Examples:
    * "Learn 10 new words this week."
    * "Be able to order a coffee in [language] by the end of the month."
